<title>USA: Living Centers of America FY net rises.</title>
<headline>Living Centers of America FY net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						Years Ended September 30,</p>
<p>						   1996     1995     1994</p>
<p> Total Revenues			 1,114,491  893,869  708,873</p>
<p>Non-recurring items:</p>
<p>    Life insurance proceeds	   (2,015)	 --	 --</p>
<p>    Gain on sale			 (22,451)	 --	 --</p>
<p>    Impairment of long-lived assets  20,489	 --	 --</p>
<p>    Other				     2,917	 --	 --</p>
<p>    Merger and acquisition costs	   --   12,474	 --</p>
<p> Net Income				  43,180   24,234   26,616</p>
<p>Pro forma data (unaudited):</p>
<p> Income before pro forma taxes	 43,180   24,234   26,616</p>
<p> Pro forma taxes				 --	599	899</p>
<p> Pro forma net income		    43,180   23,635   25,717</p>
<p>Weighted average common and common</p>
<p>  equivalent shares outstanding	20,315   19,034   17,080</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share			  2.13     1.27     1.56</p>
<p> Pro Forma Earnings Per Share	    2.13     1.24     1.51</p>
<p>NOTE: Company divested Living Centers-DevCon during Q4 1996. Proceeds were used to repay bank debt.</p>
